<!--
  Interim HLAstandardMIM module for the gorti project.

  PROVENANCE NOTICE — READ BEFORE USING DOWNSTREAM:

  This file is an INTERIM hand-derived approximation of the HLAstandardMIM
  module per IEEE Std 1516.1-2010 §4.13. It is NOT a verbatim copy of any
  IEEE-published artifact; for cut-1, the standard MIM (`standard-mim.xml`
