  loads on top with no additional declarations. This satisfies parser
  contract checks (FR-FOM-3) without claiming spec-faithfulness.

  Canonical sourcing tracked in:

      https://github.com/cbchoi/gorti/issues/1

  Owner: orchestrator (vendored exception per docs/ORTHOGONALITY.md §2).
-->
